# =============================================================
# .gitignore - Piriscope (Grupo 6, C088)
# =============================================================

# --- Datos (no se versionan; viven en Hugging Face datasets) ---
# Se conserva la estructura de carpetas mediante .gitkeep
data/*
!data/bronze/
!data/silver/
!data/gold/
data/bronze/*
data/silver/*
data/gold/*
!data/bronze/.gitkeep
!data/silver/.gitkeep
!data/gold/.gitkeep

# --- Excepciones: ficheros de data/ que SI se versionan ---
# Documentación de la carpeta de datos
!data/README.md
# Scripts (.py) sueltos en data/ o en la raíz de cada capa
!data/*.py
!data/bronze/*.py
!data/silver/*.py
!data/gold/*.py
# Muestras pequeñas para pruebas (pytest / GitHub Actions)
!data/sample/
!data/sample/**

# --- Modelos serializados (se guardan en Hugging Face / models/) ---
# Si decidís versionar modelos pequeños en el repositorio, borrad estas 2 líneas
models/*
!models/.gitkeep

# --- Secretos y credenciales (API key de AEMET, HF_TOKEN...) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.streamlit/secrets.toml
secrets/
*.secret
*.key

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Pruebas y cobertura (pytest) ---
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# --- Jupyter / análisis exploratorio (EDA) ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Cachés locales (Hugging Face, Streamlit, etc.) ---
.cache/
.huggingface/

# --- Logs y temporales ---
*.log
logs/
tmp/
*.tmp

# --- Editores y sistema operativo ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db